    "chunk_text": "olfres to borge. SE08B8 \u00dea onsoc se o\u00feer eft ond cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t he him nan feoh ne sealde. SE08B10 \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t seolfor ahte; Uton gangan to Audomares ciricean, ond me \u00fe\u00e6r gecy\u00fe SE08B12 \u00dea eodon hi o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t hi gesawon \u00fea ciricean. SE08B13 \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se se \u00fe\u00e6s feos manode, God bi\u00fe \u00e6ghw\u00e6r ondweard. SE08B15 Swere me her \u00fe\u00e6t wit standa\u00fe. SE08B15 \u00dea wolde he swerian. SE08B16 \u00dea feol he sona ni\u00feerweard on \u00fea eor\u00fean, ond him toburston \u00f0a eagan, ond he lifde twegen SE11A1 On \u00f0one XI d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00fe \u00f0ara haligra wera tid sancti Proti ond sancti Iacinthi. SE11A2 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron Eugenian \u00feegenas \u00f0\u00e6re \u00e6\u00feelan f\u00e6mnan, ond hio onfengon fulwihte mid hire. SE11A4 Ond \u00fea on Galienus dagum \u00fe\u00e6s kaseres het Necetius, Romeburge gerefa, hi l\u00e6dan to \u00feures SE11A7 \u00d0a dydon hi gebed to Drihtne, \u00fea feol \u00fe\u00e6t deofolgild to hyra fotum ond wear\u00fe eal SE11A9 \u00dea het se refa hi for\u00f0\u00e6m beheafdian, ond hi w\u00e6ron Cristes martyras gefremede. SE14A1 On \u00f0one XIIII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00fees bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s bisceopes \u00f0rowung sancti Corneli in Rome. SE14A2 \u00d0one nydde Decius se kasere deofolgeld to begang",
